meta {
  name: Create blog post
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blogs
  body: multipartForm
  auth: inherit
}

body:multipart-form {
  title: Second Test Blog
  description: A huge Description of my second test blog
  file: @file(C:\Users\Maxmillian\Desktop\The cat.pdf)
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Create Blog Post
  
  Creates a new blog post with a title, optional description, and an attached document file. The file is uploaded to Cloudinary under the `/Cedarrise Initiative/BLOG` folder.
  
  ## Endpoint
  `POST /api/v1/blogs`
  
  ## Authorization
  Inherited — requires authentication.
  
  ## Request Body (`multipart/form-data`)
  
  | Field       | Type   | Required | Constraints                                    | Description                     |
  | :---------- | :----- | :------- | :--------------------------------------------- | :------------------------------ |
  | title       | string | Yes      | Minimum 3 characters                           | The title of the blog post.     |
  | description | string | No       | —                                              | An optional blog description.   |
  | file        | file   | Yes      | PDF, DOC, DOCX, XLS, or XLSX. Max size: 20 MB. | The document file for the blog. |
  
  ### Accepted MIME Types
  - `application/pdf`
  - `application/msword`
  - `application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document`
  - `application/vnd.ms-excel`
  - `application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet`
  
  ## Success Response
  - **Status Code**: `201 Created`
  - **Body**:
    ```json
    {
      "success": true,
      "message": "Blog created successfully",
      "data": {
        "id": "uuid",
        "title": "Second Test Blog",
        "description": "A huge Description of my second test blog",
        "documentUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/...",
        "publicId": "Cedarrise Initiative/BLOG/...",
        "date": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
      }
    }
    ```
  
  ## Error Responses
  - **400 Bad Request**: Validation failed (e.g., title too short, missing file, unsupported MIME type, file exceeds 20 MB).
  - **500 Internal Server Error**: Cloudinary upload failed.
  
  ## Notes
  - The file field name must be `file` (used by multer's `upload.single("file")`).
  - The newly created blog is immediately cached under `cedarrise:blogs:single:{id}` with a 1-hour TTL.
}
